       | 
       | \[
       | 2\,(9-d)
       | \]
       | 
       | shifty functions.
       | 
       | Summing over the 22 possibilities for \(B\):
       | 
       | \[
       | \begin{aligned}
       | \#\text{shifty}=&\;2\sum_{B}(9-\deg B)\\
       | =&\;2\Bigl[9\cdot 22-\sum_{B}\deg B\Bigr]\\
       | =&\;2\Bigl[198- (1\cdot1+2\cdot2+4\cdot4+6\cdot6+8\cdot8)\Bigr]\\
       | =&\;160 .
       | \end{aligned}
       | \]
       | 
