       | # Define the linear function L = 2*u + a*v + b*w, where (u,v,w)∈[0,1]^3
       | u, v, w = sp.symbols('u v w', real=True)
       | 
       | L = 2*u + a*v + b*w
       | 
       | # The region of water in the unit cube is L ≤ 7.
