       | \end{pmatrix}
       | =
       | \begin{pmatrix}
       | -x^{4}+2x\\[1mm]
       | -(1-x)^{4}+2(1-x)
       | \end{pmatrix}.
       | \]
       | 
       | ---
       | 
       | ### 2. When is the system singular?
       | 
